window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"trundle","b":"locke","win":["Trundle","Trundle","Trundle","Trundle","Skill","Locke","Skill"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 1-3","text":"Chomp saps his AD on every bite and Frozen Domain turns the lane into your healing zone; Ritual Nails is 10s at rank 1, so walk him down the moment a set whiffs and tax every trade."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Subjugate wins any straight all-in, but Purgatory executes you mid-drain and both ultimates run 120/100/80 - bait the totem out before you ever commit yours."},{"when":"1st item","text":"His first AP item is the danger window: Soul Ignition attack speed plus Silver Stake scaling off your missing health cuts through your sustain, so only fight with Subjugate up."},{"when":"Late","text":"Late is a totem-tracking game - land Subjugate before Purgatory drops and you out-drain him, but committing into a held execute is how Trundles die."}],"wants":{"you":["Chomp every 3.5s to stack stolen AD","Every trade fought inside W Frozen Domain","His R totem baited out before you commit Subjugate"],"foe":["Poke with Ritual Nails from 950 range","Save R Purgatory to execute you mid-drain","Blink out on Ashen Pursuit's flat 10s cooldown"]},"early":"Levels 1-4 are your playground. Chomp saps his AD on a flat 3.5s while Soul Ignition burns his own health bar to trade, and King's Tribute heals you off the wave - fight on your ice, hold Pillar for the window after Ashen Pursuit, and tax every CS he steps up to take.","mid":"At 6 the lane turns into a timing war. Subjugate drains him in any committed fight, but a saved Purgatory executes you mid-drain, and both ultimates run 120/100/80 - mirrored, so whoever spends first loses. Silver Stake also grows with your missing health, so his autos hit harder the longer you linger low. Leave early.","late":"Late stays skill-bound: you out-sustain him in every extended fight and Subjugate turns his frame into a second health bar for you, but one held execute flips that same fight. Ashen Pursuit is a flat 10s at every rank - the ten seconds after he spends it is your window. Force Purgatory out first.","whys":["Chomp saps his AD on a 3.5s and King's Tribute heals off the wave - level 1 yours.","At 2 Soul Ignition burns his own health to trade - but it refunds part of that damage when the burn ends.","Frozen Domain at 3 turns every skirmish into your healing zone with bonus attack and move speed.","Through 4-5 you stay ahead on stolen stats and sustain - he cannot out-trade you on your ice.","At 6 it is a skill check: both ultimates run 120/100/80, and Purgatory executes you mid-Subjugate.","His first item plus a held execute deletes you, and Silver Stake hits harder the lower you already are.","Late fights come down to skill - whether he lands the totem on you after Subjugate or you drain him down first."]});
