window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"trundle","b":"zaahen","win":["Skill","Skill","Trundle","Zaahen","Skill","Trundle","Zaahen"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 3","text":"Your first real window: Chomp plus Frozen Domain gives sustain and attack speed he cannot match yet - force extended trades on your ice, with Grievous Wounds already on him."},{"when":"Lvl 4-5","text":"The Darkin Glaive poke and Aureate Rush burst come online and punish you off-domain; shorten trades, hug your ice, and hold Pillar of Ice for his dash, not for poke."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Both ults land: Subjugate takes 40% of his resists plus a fifth of his max health, and Grim Deliverance heals him back off the damage it deals - whoever commits on their terms wins."},{"when":"2 items","text":"His Darkin Glaive resets and Aureate Rush burst outpace your drain; stop duelling raw, spend Pillar of Ice on the dash, and fight only with Subjugate and Domain up."}],"wants":{"you":["Pillar of Ice saved for Aureate Rush","Grievous Wounds on before any long trade","Subjugate before Grim Deliverance is cast"],"foe":["Poking with The Darkin Glaive off your ice","Bursting in with Aureate Rush, then backing off","Saving Grim Deliverance to heal through your drain"]},"early":"Levels 1-2 are a quiet last-hit lane - neither your Frozen Domain trade pattern nor his Aureate Rush burst is online yet, so farm and stay healthy. Level 3 is your window: on your ice with Chomp up you win every extended trade, so force them before his 4-5 power arrives.","mid":"At 4-5 he takes over with The Darkin Glaive poke and Aureate Rush burst whenever Domain is down, so play the cooldown game and freeze near tower. Hold Pillar of Ice for the dash at 10s, not for poke. Level 6 is a skill fight - Subjugate out-drains him, but Grim Deliverance at 110s heals him off his own damage, so commit first or not at all.","late":"On your first item Frozen Domain uptime and Subjugate's drain restore your edge in sustained duels, and that is when to force fights, because two items in his Darkin Glaive resets and Aureate Rush burst you down first - and Cultivation of War lets him revive once Determination is full.","whys":["Level 1 is a neutral last-hit lane - no real combat tools online for either side.","Level 2 stays even: your Frozen Domain and his Aureate Rush burst are both still unlearned.","Level 3 is yours - Chomp plus Frozen Domain gives you the sustain and DPS to win any trade on your ice.","At 4-5 he pulls ahead as The Darkin Glaive poke and Aureate Rush burst punish you off-domain.","Level 6 is even - Subjugate against Grim Deliverance at 110s comes down to who commits first.","On your first item Frozen Domain uptime and Subjugate's magic-damage drain restore your edge in long duels.","Two items in he reclaims the lane - Darkin Glaive resets and Aureate Rush burst you down before the drain lands."]});
