window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"trundle","b":"masteryi","win":["Trundle","Trundle","Trundle","Skill","Skill","Master Yi","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 1-3","text":"You bully him hard: Chomp saps his AD every 3.5s, Frozen Domain out-paces Meditate's 10s channel, and Pillar terrain cuts his Alpha Strike lane - take every trade and bank CS."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Highlander is a flat 85s against Subjugate's 120/100/80 and grants immunity to every slow - fight before he presses it, and wait out Alpha Strike, which leaves him untargetable."},{"when":"1st item","text":"His first item plus Wuju Style's true damage out-races Chomp, and armour answers none of it - buy Grievous Wounds for Meditate and fight only with Domain up."},{"when":"Late","text":"Two-plus items he shreds with true damage and resets; Pillar peels as a wall now, since Highlander ignores every slow you own."}],"wants":{"you":["Constant Chomp trades before his items arrive","Pillar terrain on his Alpha Strike lane","A farm lead banked from the early bully phase"],"foe":["Autos that shorten Alpha Strike's 20s","Meditate on a flat 10s to heal off chip","Highlander's slow immunity to chase you"]},"early":"Levels 1-3 you own him. Chomp saps his AD every 3.5s and King's Tribute heals you off the wave, Frozen Domain's attack speed out-paces Meditate's flat 10s channel, and Pillar's terrain cuts the lane Alpha Strike wants - trade constantly and bank a farm deficit he feels all game.","mid":"Levels 4-5 flatten out with no clean kill threat, and 6 is less even than it looks: Highlander is a flat 85s against Subjugate's 120/100/80, so his ultimate returns long before yours. While it is up he is immune to all slows, taking Chomp's and Pillar's off the table and leaving you the wall. Bank the lead now.","late":"From his first item on, Wuju Style's true damage out-races your bite sustain and armour answers none of it. At two-plus items his shred and Highlander resets out-scale any duel - stop 1v1ing him, freeze near tower, and peel with Pillar as a wall rather than as a slow, because Highlander ignores slows.","whys":["Chomp saps his AD on a flat 3.5s - every level-1 trade is yours to take.","At 2 Frozen Domain's attack speed still out-paces Meditate's flat 10s channel.","Level 3 Pillar terrain plus a 3.5s Chomp out-trades him before any item lands.","Levels 4-5 are even - both of you are scaling and neither has a clean kill threat yet.","At 6 Highlander is a flat 85s against your 120/100/80 - his ult returns sooner.","His first item plus Wuju Style true damage out-races Chomp and armour.","Two-plus items plus Highlander's slow immunity leave you only Pillar's wall."]});
